(7684735, 1257987, 18197, '<td valign="top">Never over estimate voters. <br/> <br/>The connection to the theme wasnt obvious, so I suspect a bunch of low DNMC votes. What it was, wasnt obvious. Voters seem to prefer color palettes toward the blue end of the spectrum, rather than reds and oranges (my subjective conclusion, not based on statistical analysis.) As stated elsewhere, blur without some focused element to rest the eye is difficult for voters.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 3, because of some of the notions above. I couldnt figure out what it was that was inside, and what it was inside of.<br/> <br/>If youre interested in black holes, you might like a book titled <u>Black Hole Survival Guide</u> by Janna Levin.</td>', 'Never over estimate voters.  The connection to the theme wasnt obvious, so I suspect a bunch of low DNMC votes. What it was, wasnt obvious. Voters seem to prefer color palettes toward the blue end of the spectrum, rather than reds and oranges (my subjective conclusion, not based on statistical analysis.) As stated elsewhere, blur without some focused element to rest the eye is difficult for voters. I gave it a 3, because of some of the notions above. I couldnt figure out what it was that was inside, and what it was inside of. If youre interested in black holes, you might like a book titled Black Hole Survival Guide by Janna Levin.', '2021-01-18 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684750, 1257993, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> When were you there???  I was just processing some shots of that very truck! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The end of December, for 2 days this time. Almost exactly 10 years since we''ve been there together, can you believe that? I actually mentioned you when I wrote about this little trip on FB a couple of weeks ago, did you see that?</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: When were you there???  I was just processing some shots of that very truck!  The end of December, for 2 days this time. Almost exactly 10 years since we''ve been there together, can you believe that? I actually mentioned you when I wrote about this little trip on FB a couple of weeks ago, did you see that?', '2021-01-18 14:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
